# Never send runtime settings, local test credentials or signing material to Docker.
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
**/.gphase*
**/.audit*
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/.docker
**/.npmrc
**/.yarnrc*
**/credentials.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.mobileprovision
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*

# Install dependencies inside Linux. Keep source, package manifests and bun.lock.
**/node_modules
**/.pnp*
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/web-build
**/.turbo
**/.swc
**/.cache
**/.bun
**/.expo
**/.expo-shared
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.eslintcache
**/expo-env.d.ts

# Local data, downloaded releases and diagnostic output are not application source.
**/backups
**/exports
**/artifacts
**/releases
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.ipa
**/*.log
**/*.dump
**/*.backup
**/*.bak
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
Claude outputs

# Documentation is not read by application builds or runtimes.
docs
**/README.md
**/AGENTS.md

# Repository metadata and editor/agent state.
**/.git
**/.github
**/.codex
